{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35459","headline":"长安客舍叙邵陵旧宴寄永州萧使君五首 一 · 曹唐","name":"长安客舍叙邵陵旧宴寄永州萧使君五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"邵陵佳树碧葱茏，河汉西沈宴未终。\n残漏五更传海月，清笳三会揭天风。\n香熏舞席云鬟绿，光射头盘蜡烛红。\n今日却怀行乐处，两床丝竹水楼中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"曹唐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35459.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35459","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}